## CRITICAL RED FLAGS (IF TRIGGERED, COURSE CORRECT)

| Red Flag | Trigger Level | Immediate Action |
|----------|--------------|-----------------|
| Booking growth | <25% QoQ | Audit marketing; change channels or increase spend |
| Partner churn | >15% monthly | Investigate earnings; conduct partner survey; raise commissions |
| CAC inflation | >₹250 | Shift to referral/organic; reduce paid marketing temporarily |
| App rating | Falls below 4.3 | Product emergency; escalate support; fix top complaints |
| Platform downtime | >0.5% (>3.6 hours/month) | Hire DevOps; migrate infrastructure; add redundancy |
| Repeat booking | <40% | Product review; loyalty program missing features |
| Commission margin | <12% | Operating cost audit; eliminate low-margin bookings |

