## QUICK REFERENCE: PARTNER ECONOMICS

**The Math That Must Work** (or entire model fails):

| Party | Economics | Risk |
|-------|-----------|------|
| **Kashi Taxi** | ₹1000-1500/ride commission (15%) | If partners leave, revenue dies |
| **Vehicle Partner** | ₹500-1000/ride fixed OR ₹10K/month guarantee | Must break even or they switch to Ola |
| **Driver** | ₹7000-9000/week guaranteed + tips | If driver earnings <₹12K/month, high churn |
| **Customer** | ₹300-500 avg ride cost | Must be <Ola/Uber or we lose bookings |

**Unit Economics Validation**:
- GMV per vehicle per month: ₹3-4 Lakh (assuming 60-80 rides/month × ₹400 avg)
- Kashi commission (15%): ₹45-60K
- Operational cost per vehicle: ₹15-25K
- **Profit per vehicle: ₹25-40K/month** ✓ Sustainable

